{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q31", "domain": "study", "question": "命主的学历状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "### 分析推理\n\n学历主要看印星（正印、偏印）的状态，以及官杀、食伤的配合。命主日主丁火，生于酉月金旺之地，八字金重火弱。印星为木，月干时干双透乙木偏印，贴身相生，说明命主有学习领悟能力。但乙木在地支缺乏强根（无寅卯亥未等），仅有巳中丙火为劫财，未中乙木未现，印星虚浮无力，代表学业基础不牢固或早期教育环境不佳。年柱庚申正财旺，财星克印，早年易因经济或现实压力阻碍学业。\n\n看大运：女命年干庚阳金，大运逆排。从白露（9月7日）逆数14天，约5岁起运。第一步甲申运（5-14岁），甲木正印透出，看似有利，但坐申金截脚受克，印星受损，对应小学初中阶段学业不顺，恐有波折或辍学倾向。第二步癸未运（15-24岁），未为木库，乙木偏印得根，印星有力，此阶段学业运势回升，能重拾书本，完成较高学历（如专科、大学）。但原局印星始终偏弱，难达博士层次。\n\n综合来看，命主早期学业坎坷，后运势补救，可取得中等偏上学历，专科毕业最为贴近。\n\n### 最终答案\nC", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "female_19800921_P007-Q31", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 19891, "response_id": "6d252177-3625-4c92-9140-08ba4b89b53e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 205, "completion_tokens": 1051, "total_tokens": 1256, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 726}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 205}}
{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q32", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主的婚姻状况如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，命主丁火生于酉月，金旺身弱，原局官杀（夫星）藏而不透，夫缘浅薄。日支婚姻宫为酉金偏财，财旺生官但官不显，需大运扶助。早年癸未、壬午大运透出官杀，丁壬合，有婚缘，其中壬午运（24-33岁）日主得禄根，可担官星，应有结婚之象。时柱乙巳为子女宫，藏戊土伤官（子星），年支申中亦藏戊土伤官，原局子星双显；女儿需食神运引动，大运流年遇未土食神时，可得一女，故有一子一女。中年行辛巳、庚辰运，财旺身弱，夫妻宫逢合，感情不稳。尤其在2023癸卯年，流年卯木正印冲克日支酉金婚姻宫，天干癸水七杀透出，引动婚灾，是离婚的明显信号。因此，命主婚姻不顺，应已离异，育有一子一女。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "female_19800921_P007-Q32", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 72143, "response_id": "bd0ec04f-7749-4a80-8d83-4f3f03e7a6e3", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 219, "completion_tokens": 3439, "total_tokens": 3658, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 3183}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 91}}
